"UP ON THE HOUSETOP"UP ON THE HOUSETOPREINDEER PAUSE,OUT JUMPS GOOD OLD SANTA CLAUS;DOWN THRU THE CHIMNEY WITHLOTS OF TOYS,ALL FOR THE LITTLE ONES,CHRISTMAS JOYS.HO, HO, HO! WHO WOULDN'T GO!HO, HO, HO! WHO WOULDN'T GO!UP ON THE HOUSETOP,CLICK, CLICK, CLICK;DOWN THRU THE CHIMNEY WITHGOÔD SAINT NICK.FIRST COMES THE STOCKING OFLITTLE NELL;OH, DEAR SANTA FILL IT WELL;GIVE HER A DOLLY THATLAUGHS AND CRIES,ONE THAT WILL OPEN ANDSHUT HER EYES.HO, HO, HO! WHO WOULDN'T GO!HO, HO, HO! WHO WOULDN'T GO!UP ON THE HOUSETOP,CLICK, CLICK, CLICK;DOWN THRU THE CHIMNEY WITHGOOD SAINT NICK.NEXT COMES THE STOCKING OFLITTLE WILL;OH, JUST SEE WHAT A GLORIOUS FILL!HERE IS A HAMMER ANDLOTS OF TACKS,ALSO A BALL AND AWHIP THAT CRACKS.HO, HO, HO! WHO WOULDN'T GO!HO, HO, HO! WHO WOULDN'T GO!UP ON TH HOUSETOP,CLICK, CLICK, CLICK;DOWN THRU THE CHIMNEY WITHGOOD SAINT NICK